2\", \"title\": \"Discrete-time portfolio optimization under maximum drawdown constraint with partial information and deep learning resolution\", \"score\": 2, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Max-drawdown-constrained portfolio with Bayesian drift uncertainty, solved numerically via deep learning stochastic control.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2401.02601v1\", \"title\": \"Constrained Max Drawdown: a Fast and Robust Portfolio Optimization Approach\", \"score\": 2, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Linearized Markowitz via max drawdown minimization; out-of-sample results, 200x faster MILP; drawdown-control transferable.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1404.7493v5\", \"title\": \"Drawdown: From Practice to Theory and Back Again\", \"score\": 2, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Conditional Expected Drawdown: convex, degree-one, factor-attributable risk measure with empirical exploration.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1403.8125v4\", \"title\": \"Maximum drawdown, recovery, and momentum\", \"score\": 2, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Empirically tests drawdown-based momentum selection across equity markets; real-data results.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1710.00431v2\", \"title\": \"Kelly's Criterion in Portfolio Optimization: A Decoupled Problem\", \"score\": 2, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Kelly incorporated into standard portfolio optimization with a risk parameter; solved for a portfolio of 10 real stocks.\"}\n{\"id\": \"0804.2288v1\", \"title\": \"Parimutuel Betting on Permutations\", \"score\": 2, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Parimutuel betting on permutations; sports-betting market model relevant to exotic/pooled markets.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1806.05293v1\", \"title\": \"Generalized framework for applying the Kelly criterion to stock markets\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Generalized Kelly framework applied to stock markets; conceptually transferable but finance-domain only.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2004.14048v2\", \"title\": \"On Feedback Control in Kelly Betting: An Approximation Approach\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Taylor-based quadratic approximation to Kelly betting with closed-form solution; theoretical, no empirical results.\"}\n{\"id\": \"0712.2771v3\", \"title\": \"Analysis of Kelly-optimal portfolios\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Analytical Kelly-optimal portfolios for lognormal returns; theoretical but gives closed-form sizing intuitions.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1807.05265v2\", \"title\": \"Rebalancing Frequency Considerations for Kelly-Optimal Stock Portfolios in a Control-Theoretic Framework\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Rebalancing frequency analysis for Kelly-optimal portfolios; transferable to bet-recycling frequency questions.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2004.12099v1\", \"title\": \"Necessary and Sufficient Conditions for Frequency-Based Kelly Optimal Portfolio\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Optimality characterizations for frequency-based Kelly portfolios; theory-heavy.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1708.03813v1\", \"title\": \"Weighted entropy and optimal portfolios for risk-averse Kelly investments\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Risk-averse Kelly via weighted-entropy log-optimal portfolios; theoretical extension of proportional betting.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1311.2550v2\", \"title\": \"The Kelly growth optimal strategy with a stop-loss rule\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Kelly growth-optimal strategy with a stop-loss rule via HJB; theoretical drawdown-control machinery.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1904.06628v2\", \"title\": \"Nash Bargaining Over Margin Loans to Kelly Gamblers\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Nash bargaining over margin loans to Kelly gamblers; practical leverage formulas for leveraged bettors.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2005.11698v2\", \"title\": \"Phase transitions in optimal strategies for betting\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Phase transitions in optimal betting strategies; statistical-physics view of betting regimes, theory-only.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1506.00166v2\", \"title\": \"Optimal Investment to Minimize the Probability of Drawdown\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Optimal investment to minimize probability of drawdown in Black-Scholes; theoretical.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2505.22422v2\", \"title\": \"STaR-Bets: Sequential Target-Recalculating Bets for Tighter Confidence Intervals\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"STaR-Bets: sequential target-recalculating bets for tighter confidence intervals; experimental, transferable to sequential betting decisions.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2112.14451v1\", \"title\": \"Dynamic growth-optimum portfolio choice under risk control\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"kelly_sizing\", \"rationale\": \"Dynamic growth-optimum portfolio choice under risk control; transferable risk-capped growth framework.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1907.00208v2\", \"title\": \"Deep Gamblers: Learning to Abstain with Portfolio Theory\", \"score\": 3, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Deep Gamblers: (m+1)-class abstention via portfolio-theory doubling-rate loss; directly ties abstention to betting theory.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1901.09192v4\", \"title\": \"SelectiveNet: A Deep Neural Network with an Integrated Reject Option\", \"score\": 2, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"SelectiveNet: end-to-end deep selective prediction optimizing classification and rejection jointly; experimental.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2606.23448v1\", \"title\": \"Selective Time Series Forecasting via Metalearning\", \"score\": 2, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Selective time-series forecasting via metalearning; abstention for forecasting tasks, transferable to game forecasts.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2607.24875v1\", \"title\": \"FinAbstain: Uncertainty-Calibrated Multimodal RAG for Selective Financial Forecasting\", \"score\": 2, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"FinAbstain: uncertainty-calibrated selective financial forecasting with point-in-time RAG; selective forecasting framework.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2505.23437v2\", \"title\": \"Bounded-Abstention Pairwise Learning to Rank\", \"score\": 2, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Bounded-abstention pairwise learning to rank; abstention for ranked decision systems, transferable to pick ranking.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2111.08230v1\", \"title\": \"Selective Ensembles for Consistent Predictions\", \"score\": 2, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Selective ensembles for consistent predictions; experimental ensemble abstention.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2502.07255v2\", \"title\": \"Beyond Confidence: Adaptive Abstention in Dual-Threshold Conformal Prediction for Autonomous System Perception\", \"score\": 2, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Adaptive abstention in dual-threshold conformal prediction; calibrated abstention machinery.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2503.23782v1\", \"title\": \"Distributional regression with reject option\", \"score\": 2, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Distributional regression with reject option; matches GSE's distributional-regression setting (totals), can abstain under high uncertainty.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2404.11350v3\", \"title\": \"Calibrating Bayesian Learning via Regularization, Confidence Minimization, and Selective Inference\", \"score\": 2, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Calibrating Bayesian learning via regularization, confidence minimization, and selective inference; experimental.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2603.09947v1\", \"title\": \"The Confidence Gate Theorem: When Should Ranked Decision Systems Abstain?\", \"score\": 2, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Confidence Gate Theorem: principled conditions for when ranked decision systems should abstain; directly relevant to pick selection.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2508.07617v2\", \"title\": \"Selective Prediction Reduces the Negative Effects of Automation Bias Overall but Increases False Negatives\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Selective prediction reduces automation bias in human-in-loop settings; relevant to approval workflows, not prediction quality.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1312.3989v1\", \"title\": \"Classifiers With a Reject Option for Early Time-Series Classification\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Reject option for early time-series classification using ensemble agreement; experimental but signal-processing domain.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2501.08397v1\", \"title\": \"Predict Confidently, Predict Right: Abstention in Dynamic Graph Learning\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Reject option in dynamic graph learning for continuous-time graphs; experimental, weak transfer to sports.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1906.02179v2\", \"title\": \"Bayesian Active Learning With Abstention Feedbacks\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Bayesian active learning where the labeler can abstain; experimental, label-noise setting.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2412.03190v1\", \"title\": \"Node Classification With Integrated Reject Option\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Node classification with integrated reject option in GNNs; experimental, weak transfer.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1911.11253v1\", \"title\": \"Playing it Safe: Adversarial Robustness with an Abstain Option\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Adversarial robustness with an abstain option; experimental, adversarial focus.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1505.04137v1\", \"title\": \"Consistent Algorithms for Multiclass Classification with a Reject Option\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Consistent algorithms for multiclass classification with a reject option; theory-heavy.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2307.05199v1\", \"title\": \"Reject option models comprising out-of-distribution detection\", \"score\": 1, \"lane\": \"abstention\", \"rationale\": \"Reject option models for