{"id": "arxiv-sweep/waves/wave1-worker2-status.jsonl", "corpus": "arxiv-sweep", "kind": "wave", "chars": 5189, "equations": [], "text": "{\"id\":\"2509.25858v1\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0039-basketball-aging-decline-lstm.md\",\"title\":\"Basketball Aging Decline (autoencoder archetypes + LSTM)\",\"notes\":\"Erroneous draft metadata corrected from arXiv 2509.26088v1 to assigned ID 2509.25858v1; full 306-line text read; draft replaced. Adapt player-archetype + cluster-conditioned LSTM aging models to NFL aging/props.\"}\n{\"id\":\"2509.12592v1\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0040-match-chat-generative-ai-tennis.md\",\"title\":\"Match Chat: Generative AI Tennis (pre-match XGBoost + live momentum)\",\"notes\":\"Full 808-line text read; draft REJECT corrected to ADAPT after live Likelihood-to-Win model (equations 1-12) found. Adapt decayed momentum blend to thin live-NFL lane; reject chatbot stack.\"}\n{\"id\":\"2605.05487v1\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0211-crossindividual-generalizability-of-machine-learning-models.md\",\"title\":\"Cross-Individual Generalizability of ML Models\",\"notes\":\"Full 689-line text read (header fixed to exact count). Adapt LOSOCV/leave-one-player-out validation and signed residual ability analysis to NFL props; baseball biomechanics do not transfer.\"}\n{\"id\":\"2602.23288v1\",\"verdict\":\"REJECT\",\"ledger\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0212-bridge-borderless-reconfiguration-for-inclusive-and.md\",\"title\":\"BRIDGE: Borderless Reconfiguration for Inclusive and ... (wheelchair basketball CHI)\",\"notes\":\"Full 2884-line text read through EOF (remainder confirmed references only; header fixed to exact count). No NFL prediction/calibration/betting transfer path.\"}\n{\"id\":\"2601.14727v3\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0213-recent-advances-in-the-bradleyterry-model.md\",\"title\":\"Recent Advances in the Bradley-Terry Model: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications\",\"notes\":\"Full 5814-line text read. Theory survey, no new experiments. Use as implementation reference for BT team-rating module: Newman FPI, RankCentrality/LSR, covariate-assisted PlusDC (home-field/dynamic covariates), mixture identifiability guidance. BT concept already inventoried; this is the extension reference.\"}\n{\"id\":\"2512.15386v1\",\"verdict\":\"REJECT\",\"ledger\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0214-see-it-before-you-grab-it.md\",\"title\":\"See It Before You Grab It: Deep Learning-based Rebound Anticipation in Basketball\",\"notes\":\"Full 3736-line text read incl. all results. Basketball broadcast-video rebound anticipation; no transfer to current GSE lanes; dataset NBA-permission-gated; online macro-F1 ~0.29 below any bar. TEAM architecture noted as generic recipe only.\"}\n{\"id\":\"2504.12021v1\",\"verdict\":\"REJECT\",\"ledger\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0215-action-anticipation-from-soccernet-football-video.md\",\"title\":\"Action Anticipation from SoccerNet Football Video Broadcasts (FAANTRA)\",\"notes\":\"Full 2523-line text read incl. ablations. Soccer-video anticipation; the parent method of 0214's TEAM. Same rejection rationale: no NFL-video lane, mAP@delta=1 = 9.74, rare high-impact events worst-performing. Kept as the reference if an NFL-video lane ever opens (code/dataset public).\"}\n{\"id\":\"2504.00767v1\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0216-automated-explanation-of-machine-learning-models.md\",\"title\":\"Automated Explanation of Machine Learning Models of Footballing Actions in Words\",\"notes\":\"Full 860-line text read. Wordalisation pipeline (log-odds contributions -> synthesized text -> LLM few-shot rewrite; Case 4 = highest engagement + 2nd-highest accuracy) directly portable to GSE pick-explanation content lane: engine-pick feature contributions -> engaging faithful narratives for X/feed/newsletter. Needs deterministic fidelity gate.\"}\n{\"id\":\"2503.19809v1\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0217-simulating-tracking-data-to-advance-sports.md\",\"title\":\"Simulating Tracking Data to Advance Sports Analytics Research\",\"notes\":\"Full 345-line text read (short demo). Adopt entity-row schema + event/stint extraction layer for GSE NGS pipeline; simulation-first prototyping lane only after a football simulator is validated; never calibrate production params on simulated data.\"}\n{\"id\":\"2504.08747v1\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0218-gridmind-a-multiagent-nlp-framework-for.md\",\"title\":\"GridMind: A Multi-Agent NLP Framework for Unified, Cross-Modal NFL Data Insights\",\"notes\":\"Full 744-line text read. Vendor paper: do not adopt the system (no code/data, proprietary metrics, 58% alpha accuracy, 17.5s latency). Adopt the agent-decomposition architecture as the reference design for GSE's conversational data layer over engine DB + nflverse + research corpus; build on GSE-owned data; fan-facing only after 85%+ eval accuracy.\"}\n"}
