{"id": "arxiv-sweep/waves/wave1-worker5-status.jsonl", "corpus": "arxiv-sweep", "kind": "wave", "chars": 4161, "equations": [], "text": "{\"id\": \"2107.07561v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0239-multivariate-conwaymaxwellpoisson-distribution-sarmanov-method-and.md\", \"notes\": \"Modified-Sarmanov multivariate COM-Poisson construction is portable for correlated low-count joint score modeling; heavy GIMH/noisy-exchange Bayesian machinery not adopted.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2108.00821v2\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0240-the-reaction-to-news-in-live.md\", \"notes\": \"First stake-level study of live-betting reaction to news; 1 Hz bookmaker stake data proprietary, so adapt the state-space design to odds-derived proxies rather than replicating stakes.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2108.05796v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"REJECT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0241-goal-scoring-in-premier-league-with.md\", \"notes\": \"Coursework-quality textbook Poisson GLM: post-event leakage (shots/corners/halftime goals), no held-out validation, selection bias; duplicates stronger Poisson/Dixon-Coles material already inventoried.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2106.05174v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0242-uefa-euro-2020-forecast-via-nested.md\", \"notes\": \"Adapt the nested conditional mechanism (simulate stronger team's score first, condition weaker team's on it) as an NFL garbage-time/prevent-defense dependence primitive; reject EURO-specific fits and full ZIGP machinery.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2103.04349v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0243-markov-cricket-using-forward-and-inverse.md\", \"notes\": \"Adapt inverse RL from winning teams' action sequences to NFL situational decisions; reject cricket-specific DLS replacement/simulator; gate requires synthetic reward-recovery validation.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2102.07545v2\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"REJECT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0244-datadriven-analysis-for-understanding-team-sports.md\", \"notes\": \"Survey with no novel results; Koopman/DMD lane already falsified in MOVE-37 (p=0.89, AR(1) wins); RL discussion less actionable than paper 0243.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1708.02715v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0245-order-flows-and-limit-order-book.md\", \"notes\": \"Adapt fixed-volume bucketing, taker/maker flow decomposition, deeper-book liquidity metrics, and scarce-liquidity detection to Kalshi/Polymarket NFL order books; central regressions are descriptive, not trading signals.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1604.05090v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0246-robust-draws-in-balanced-knockout-tournaments.md\", \"notes\": \"Narrow ADAPT: only the epsilon-worst-drop sensitivity diagnostic (multilinear alpha_ij decomposition) for futures/bracket risk; draw-fixing NP-completeness framework irrelevant (NFL bracket is fixed).\"}\n{\"id\": \"1601.04302v6\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0247-footballonomics-the-anatomy-of-american-football.md\", \"notes\": \"Adapt the FPM bootstrap prediction architecture (correlated performance-vector resampling -> distribution over win probability + hypothesis-test pick rule) and factor-magnitude priors; do not adopt the stale 2009-2015 model as-is.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1406.3402v2\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"REJECT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0248-relieving-and-readjusting-pythagoras.md\", \"notes\": \"Baseball paper; mixture-of-Weibulls beats only the single-Weibull strawman, not the deployed 1.83-exponent formula (0.06 games, n.s.); 7-parameter team fits need 162-game seasons, untransferable to 17-game NFL.\"}\n"}
