{"id": "arxiv-sweep/waves/wave2-worker4-status.jsonl", "corpus": "arxiv-sweep", "kind": "wave", "chars": 5525, "equations": [], "text": "{\"paper_id\": \"2508.05891v1\", \"title\": \"Bayesian weighted discrete-time dynamic models for association football prediction\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0279-bayesian-weighted-discretetime-dynamic-models-for.md\", \"notes\": \"Read full text (5519 lines). Port period-specific commensurate-prior time weighting to NFL latent team strengths; final-round Brier 0.593 Bundesliga / 0.545 EPL / 0.462 La Liga; 31-55% computation reductions in cited cases.\"}\n{\"paper_id\": \"2501.05873v1\", \"title\": \"Forecasting Soccer Matches through Distributions\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0280-forecasting-soccer-matches-through-distributions.md\", \"notes\": \"Read full text (1001 lines). Port latent-event-distribution to simulation architecture for NFL play-count/EPA distributions; test RPS 0.201 vs bookmaker 0.198; Strategy 2 return +1.1% but profitability evidence weak.\"}\n{\"paper_id\": \"2412.21181v1\", \"title\": \"Causal Hangover Effects\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0281-causal-hangover-effects.md\", \"notes\": \"Read full text (1114 lines). Nightlife result does not transfer to NFL; retain lagged-context + market-conditioning + placebo-test causal design for situational spots. NBA party indicator -0.557 (SE 0.149); +2.970 pts allowed (SE 0.835); placebo 0.053 (SE 0.084).\"}\n{\"paper_id\": \"2410.21484v1\", \"title\": \"A Systematic Review of Machine Learning in Sports Betting\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0282-a-systematic-review-of-machine-learning.md\", \"notes\": \"Read full text (3756 lines; references skimmed). Use as primary-paper pointer map only (adaptive fractional Kelly, Black-Litterman betting portfolios); narrative and unverified, rejected as standalone evidence.\"}\n{\"paper_id\": \"2409.01493v1\", \"title\": \"Shrouded Sin Taxes\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0283-shrouded-sin-taxes.md\", \"notes\": \"Read full text (6152 lines; theory skimmed). No prediction method to port; adopt overround-based effective-vs-posted price accounting for GSE CLV/edge pipeline. DID pass-through 76% (coef 0.038, SE 0.004); shrouding firms 90% vs non-shrouding 16%.\"}\n{\"paper_id\": \"2405.02412v1\", \"title\": \"Deep Learning and Transfer Learning Architectures for English Premier League Player Performance Forecasting\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0284-deep-learning-and-transfer-learning-architectures.md\", \"notes\": \"Read full text (1468 lines). Port 1D-CNN on recent-form window + matchup difficulty to NFL fantasy/prop projections; evaluate Spearman rank quality. Holdout MSE CNN 5.83 vs LGBM 6.71; Spearman 0.57-0.70 vs 0.40-0.53; Guardian news transfer failed (9.10).\"}\n{\"paper_id\": \"2403.16282v1\", \"title\": \"The Evolution of Football Betting: A Machine Learning Approach to Match Outcome Forecasting and Bookmaker Odds Estimation\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0285-the-evolution-of-football-betting-a.md\", \"notes\": \"Read full text. Methods rejected (accuracy-only, small sample, leakage); keep feature priors: xG/xGA/SCA/GCA dominate (NFL analog: EPA/success-rate/explosives); draws near-unpredictable (recall 0.06-0.41). Best model SVM 1-season 72.67%.\"}\n{\"paper_id\": \"2401.06086v1\", \"title\": \"XGBoost Learning of Dynamic Wager Placement for In-Play Betting on an Agent-Based Model of a Sports Betting Exchange\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0286-xgboost-learning-of-dynamic-wager-placement.md\", \"notes\": \"Read full text (358 lines). Port the imitation-learning loop (XGBoost beats every teacher, p=0.0017 vs Privileged) to GSE in-play sandbox on recorded NFL live odds; horse-race policy itself not transferable; simulator-only validation.\"}\n{\"paper_id\": \"2309.12333v1\", \"title\": \"Onchain Sports Betting using UBET Automated Market Maker\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"REJECT\", \"ledger\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0287-onchain-sports-betting-using-ubet-automated.md\", \"notes\": \"Read full text (547 lines). Vendor whitepaper for UBET Sports' own product; no prediction method, simulation-only claims assuming fair prices known; conditional-token mechanics already covered in corpus prediction-market docs. No GSE implementation.\"}\n{\"paper_id\": \"2307.13807v1\", \"title\": \"Sports Betting: an application of neural networks and modern portfolio theory to the English Premier League\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0288-sports-betting-an-application-of-neural.md\", \"notes\": \"Read full text (530 lines). Adopt matrix-form multivariate simultaneous Kelly (Eq. 13, concave, SQP) + Dirichlet-calibrated fractional Kelly (17%) as GSE portfolio staking layer; fills priority Kelly gap. Headline +135.8% wealth on 20 matchweeks not significant (pvals 0.16-0.50); EPL net itself not ported (54% acc, worse cross-entropy than market).\"}\n"}
