{"id": "arxiv-sweep/waves/wave5-worker1-status.jsonl", "corpus": "arxiv-sweep", "kind": "wave", "chars": 3771, "equations": [], "text": "{\"id\": \"2405.13397v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0389-multi-player-tracking-in-ice-hockey.md\", \"notes\": \"Homography-footpoint + graph-MPN association for monocular sports tracking; adapt to football geometry; hard legal review before any NFL broadcast-footage use.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2312.04338v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0390-stochastic-modelling-of-football-matches.md\", \"notes\": \"Cox-process framework with dynamic state-dependent intensities, strictly concave likelihood; seed for NFL live WP/spread/total modeling with NFL state regressors.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2308.01523v2\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0391-miss-it-like-messi-extracting-value.md\", \"notes\": \"Hierarchical generative execution-error model + Rao-Blackwellization transfers to kicker dispersion, QB placement, punt placement.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2307.02139v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0392-extending-the-dixon-and-coles-model.md\", \"notes\": \"Sarmanov/ANS joint distribution as challenger for NFL TD counts/exact scores vs independent NB/bivariate Poisson/Skellam baselines.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2305.14037v2\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"REJECT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0393-the-most-exciting-game.md\", \"notes\": \"Pure probability theory (max-entropy win-martingale SDE); no data, no empirical content, no implementable NFL transfer.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2303.10895v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0394-leapfrog-diffusion-model-for-stochastic-trajectory.md\", \"notes\": \"Leapfrog diffusion for stochastic trajectory prediction; 23.7%/21.9% ADE/FDE gain over MID on 2017 NFL tracking data, ~30x inference speedup; serves public-tracking-replacement lane.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2302.06569v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0395-inferring-player-location-in-sports-matches.md\", \"notes\": \"Agent Imputer: all-22 positions from sparse event data (~95% missing) at 6.9m error, 62% cut vs best naive baseline; template for imputing from NFL play-by-play.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2209.13154v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0396-observation-centric-and-central-distance-recovery.md\", \"notes\": \"OC-SORT + central-distance recovery + sport-specific ReID post-processing; HOTA 73.968, 3rd place SportsMOT 2022; image-plane MOT complement to 0389; legal review before NFL footage.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2204.04049v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0397-efficient-tracking-of-team-sport-players.md\", \"notes\": \"Few-shot identity learning: ~6 tracklet annotations/player via incremental Transformer ReID, +26pp IDF1 over ByteTrack; public rugby sevens dataset; bootstrapping step for zero-label leagues.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2110.01527v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0398-a-markov-process-approach-to-untangling.md\", \"notes\": \"MRP/MDP intention-vs-execution framework; serve-return targeting highest