{"id": "arxiv-sweep/waves/wave6-worker2-status.jsonl", "corpus": "arxiv-sweep", "kind": "wave", "chars": 3820, "equations": [], "text": "{\"id\": \"2601.12896v3\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"REJECT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0449-quantitative-methods-in-finance.md\", \"notes\": \"86,845-line pedagogical course/textbook; no original experiment, no sports transfer beyond standard methods.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2512.14727v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0450-a-critical-perspective-on-finite-sample.md\", \"notes\": \"At nominal 90% coverage and calibration size m=10, 19% of calibration sets gave conditional coverage below 85%; adopt calibration-set-conditional coverage audits for GSE conformal intervals.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2512.00342v2\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0451-adaptive-prediction-theory-combining-offline-and.md\", \"notes\": \"Adopt offline GSE model + small online meta-LMS/exponential-weighted drift layer; discard control-theoretic machinery and 500-model scale.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2509.04546v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0452-the-actuarys-final-word-on-algorithmic.md\", \"notes\": \"Adopt proper scoring-rule doctrine (Brier/log-loss), human-override logging, and staleness monitoring for GSE engine evaluation.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2505.11566v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"REJECT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0453-theory-multidimensional-space-of-events.md\", \"notes\": \"Standard Bayesian-network concepts renamed; unverifiable toy results and mutually inconsistent improvement claims.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2501.08710v2\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0454-disentangled-interleaving-variational-encoding.md\", \"notes\": \"Adopt disentangled marginal/conditional latent-space design for GSE multi-output engine; replace Naive-Bayes disentanglement loss and RBF prior with supervised contrastive objectives validated on NFL data.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2410.07401v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"REJECT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0455-enhancing-soccer-camera-calibration-through-keypoint.md\", \"notes\": \"Soccer broadcast-video camera calibration (SoccerNet Challenge 2023 winner); no transfer path to GSE's tabular engine, no video lane exists.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2409.12783v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"REJECT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0456-financial-stochastic-models-diffusion-from-riskneutral.md\", \"notes\": \"Risk-neutral to real-world measure-change machinery for CIR++ credit-spread diffusion; no sports content and no GSE analogue (no RN pricing layer).\"}\n{\"id\": \"2406.03321v2\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0457-decision-synthesis-in-monetary-policy.md\", \"notes\": \"Adopt decision-utility model weighting (BPDS): weight ensemble members by realized betting utility rather than predictive fit, with decision-dependent weights, outcome calibration, bounded scores, and entropic tilting.\"}\n{\"id\": \"2403.11016v3\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0458-comprehensive-oos-evaluation-of-predictive-algorithms.md\", \"notes\": \"Adopt minimax-regret evaluation doctrine: judge engine by maximum regret across a state space of seasons/regimes and evaluate the pick rule as a statistical decision function, not just average backtest accuracy.\"}\n"}
