{"id": "arxiv-sweep/waves/wave7-worker1-status.jsonl", "corpus": "arxiv-sweep", "kind": "wave", "chars": 3675, "equations": [], "text": "{\"arxiv_id\":\"2603.25901v1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger_path\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0489-decoding-defensive-coverage-responsibilities-in-american.md\",\"notes\":\"Defensive coverage disguise-rate and per-defender matchup attribution; port via public Big Data Bowl data, NGS/PFF labels not replicable.\"}\n{\"arxiv_id\":\"2602.19513v1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger_path\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0490-realtime-win-probability-and-latent-player.md\",\"notes\":\"Brownian closed-form win probability and Interval-on-Fire player-flow index; adapt to NFL drive data, reject direct basketball transfer.\"}\n{\"arxiv_id\":\"2601.11492v2\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger_path\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0491-boxmind-closedloop-ai-strategy-optimization-for.md\",\"notes\":\"Differentiable strategy gradients dP(win)/d(tactical indicator) for NFL matchup previews; boxing pipeline does not transfer.\"}\n{\"arxiv_id\":\"2512.18467v1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"verdict\":\"REJECT\",\"ledger_path\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0492-analysing-skill-predominance-in-generalized-fantasy.md\",\"notes\":\"Cricket limited-selection contest design; no contribution to GSE win/spread/total modeling beyond a marginal crowding-dilution insight for DFS.\"}\n{\"arxiv_id\":\"2512.08591v1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger_path\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0493-longsequence-lstm-modeling-for-nba-game.md\",\"notes\":\"Long-history LSTM as generalizable fallback prior stacked with season specialists; 9,840-step NBA design does not transfer, NFL analogue is ~150-200 game sequences on nflverse.\"}\n{\"arxiv_id\":\"2511.18730v1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger_path\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0494-largescale-ingame-outcome-forecasting-for-match.md\",\"notes\":\"Agent x time axial transformer for live in-game forecasting of game/team/player totals; fills GSE's live in-game and player-prop architecture gap.\"}\n{\"arxiv_id\":\"2511.17733v1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger_path\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0495-the-impacts-of-increasingly-complex-matchup.md\",\"notes\":\"Hierarchical Bayesian log5 matchup models with recency weighting; key lesson is evaluating features by decision-WPA not log-loss alone.\"}\n{\"arxiv_id\":\"2509.01243v1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger_path\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0496-a-novel-methodological-framework-for-analyzing.md\",\"notes\":\"CUSUM change-point flow detection and chi-square streak protocol for in-game momentum; distinct from the rejected DMD approach, falsifiable test on nflverse drives.\"}\n{\"arxiv_id\":\"2508.04008v1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger_path\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0497-leveraging-minutebyminute-soccer-match-event-data.md\",\"notes\":\"Game-script context adjustment via NegBin GAM projected onto neutral baseline; portable to NFL play-level EPA adjustment for matchup previews.\"}\n{\"arxiv_id\":\"2506.02351v1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"verdict\":\"ADAPT\",\"ledger_path\":\"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0498-diamond-an-llmdriven-agent-for-contextaware.md\",\"notes\":\"Three-stage LLM key-moment selector (sabermetrics + sliding-window LLM context + preference re-rank); content tool for GSE recap/clip product