_id\": \"1903.07218v1\", \"ledger\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0608-modelling-career-trajectories-of-cricket-players.md\", \"note\": \"Earlier conference version of 0604 by the same authors, superseded in data scale, kernel flexibility, and validation. Retain only the probabilistic player-comparison framing and per-player form-timescale findings as amendments to 0604.\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"REJECT\"}\n"}
