{"id": "arxiv-sweep/waves/wave9-worker3-status.jsonl", "corpus": "arxiv-sweep", "kind": "wave", "chars": 3452, "equations": [], "text": "{\"id\": \"1902.07378v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0609-gaussian-process-priors-for-dynamic-paired.md\", \"notes\": \"Full 2188-line text read. GP(BT-logit) with Mat\\u00e9rn 3/2 x ARD-surface kernel; Laplace+sparse-Cholesky inference; log loss 0.631 vs Elo 0.638 / Glicko 0.635 on 2018 ATP (2623 matches); fit time ~3.25e-7 n^2 s. Port to GSE as time x context-covariate rating kernel.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1806.01930v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0610-on-elo-based-prediction-models-for.md\", \"notes\": \"Full 3722-line text read. 4 Elo-Poisson models; nested Poisson best on 2010/2014 WC validation (E1=24/25, Brier 17.51/21.89); 2018 forecast missed (Germany 30.5% -> group exit). Port nested-score conditioning + E1/E2 ordinal scoring to GSE; discard tournament-simulation machinery.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1712.05879v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0611-hierarchical-bayesian-bradleyterry-for-applications-in.md\", \"notes\": \"Full 3027-line text read. Hierarchical BT: sigma~Gamma(2N,2N/sighat^2) from prior season, HMC in Stan; Bayes beats MLE early-season (Apr15 err 8.82 vs 24.65, MLB 2017). Port previous-season parity hyperprior + HMC to GSE ratings with home-field term added.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1710.06056v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"REJECT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0612-asymptotically-optimal-sequential-design-for-rank.md\", \"notes\": \"Full 20426-line text read. Asymptotic sequential pair-selection theory (Theorems 1-3, Corollary 4); K=3-4 synthetic simulations only, no real data. REJECT for GSE: NFL schedule is fixed, no adaptive pair selection. Keep Lemma 5 exponential MLE bound as a ratings-convergence diagnostic.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1705.05831v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"REJECT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0613-match-results-prediction-ability-of-official.md\", \"notes\": \"Full 963-line text read. p=x^alpha/(1+x^alpha) on ATP point ratios, alpha~0.87 stable across 20k+ matches (E^2~0.205 vs 0.323 naive). REJECT: result is a tennis point-system artifact with no NFL analog; no Elo/BT comparison in paper.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1504.01070v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADAPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0614-syncrank-robust-ranking-constrained-ranking-and.md\", \"notes\": \"Full 12133-line text read. SO(2) angular synchronization ranking; eigenvector + SDP relaxations; rank aggregation Hbar=\\u03a3H^(u); EPL/NCAA/Halo2 in-sample results (SYNC-SUP 2x best on NCAA upsets). Port EIG-AGG to fuse GSE rating sources; skip SDP except constrained variant.\"}\n{\"id\": \"1301.2954v1\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"verdict\": \"ADOPT\", \"ledger_path\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/vendor/Sports/docs/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0615-the-ranking-lasso-and-its-application.md\", \"notes\": \"Full 4521-line text read. Adaptive ranking lasso on BT (L1 on pairwise ability diffs, adaptive weights, BIC); NFL 2010-11 100x half-split CV: NLL 117.2 (BIC) vs MLE 139.9 (~16-20% gain), ~60% > coin. ADOPT for GSE: tiered NFL ratings via cvxpy, weekly walk-forward, recalibrate penalized abilities.\"}\n"}
